<title>UK: DNIB sets 10 bln peseta five-year bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 10 bln peseta five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by</p>
<p>joint lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INESTERINGSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    11.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.63    PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    AIAF	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3	 DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW     SPANISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
